{
  "id": "1SA.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samwiri 1",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Bayibuli Entukuvu, Endagaano Enkadde nʼEndagaano Empya ekwatiddwa ku katambi™ Obwannannyini© 1984, 1986, 1993, 2014 bwa Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open Luganda Contemporary Bible™ Copyright © 1984, 1986, 1993, 2014 by Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" Linnya ery'obwannannyini eryawandiisibwa Biblica mu Amerika era nga balina n'ekkakkalabozo, Inc. Bwaweebwa olukusa okulikozesa. \"Biblica\" is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission.",
  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okuzaalibwa kwa Samwiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaliwo omusajja Omwefulayimu eyabeeranga e Lamasayimuzofimu, mu nsi ey'ensozi eya Efulayimu, ng'ayitibwa Erukaana, nga mutabani wa Yerokamu, muzzukulu wa Eriku, muzzukulu wa Toku, muzzukulu wa Zufu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yalina abakyala babiri, omu nga ye Kaana; n'omulala nga ye Penina. Penina yalina abaana, naye Kaana nga mugumba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli mwaka omusajja oyo yayambukanga okuva mu kibuga ky'ewaabwe okugenda okusinza n'okuwaayo ssaddaaka eri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ow'Eggye e Siiro",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". Eyo Kofuni ne Finekaasi batabani ba Eri gye baawererezanga nga bakabona ba",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo olunaku olw'okuwaayo ssaddaaka bwe lwatuuka, Erukaana, n'awa Penina ne batabani be, ne bawala be emigabo egy'ennyama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Kaana n'amuwa emigabo ebiri kubanga yamwagala nnyo, newaakubadde nga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda yali tamuwadde mwana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era kubanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda yali tamuwadde mwana, muggya we n'amucoccanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo byabangawo buli mwaka, era bwe baayambukanga okugenda mu yeekaalu ya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", muggya we n'amujoogerezanga okutuusa lwe yakaabanga, n'okulya n'atalya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bba Erukaana n'amubuuza nti, \"Kaana, okaabiranga ki? Lwaki tolya? Kiki ekikweraliikiriza? Nze sikusingira abaana ekkumi?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwali lumu bwe baali bamaze okulya n'okunywa e Siiro, Eri yali atudde ku ntebe okumpi n'omulyango gwa yeekaalu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", Kaana n'asituka n'agenda mu maaso ga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kulumwa olw'ennaku ennyingi ennyo, n'akaaba nnyo amaziga ng'asaba",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yeeyama ng'agamba nti, \"Ayi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayinzabyonna, bw'olitunuulira ennaku ey'omuweereza wo, n'onzijukira, n'ompa omwana owoobulenzi, ndimuwaayo eri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda ennaku zonna ez'obulamu bwe nga muwonge, era enviiri ze teziimwebwengako.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Kaana bwe yeeyongera okusaba ennyo eri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda, Eri ne yeekaliriza akamwa ke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaana yali asaba mu kasirise, ng'emimwa gye ginyeenya, naye nga eddoboozi lye teriwulikika. Eri n'alowooza nti atamidde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri kyeyava amugamba nti, \"Olikomya ddi okujjanga wano ng'otamidde? Ggyawo ettamiiro lyo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Kaana n'amuddamu nti, \"Si bwe kiri mukama wange; nze ndi mukazi ajjudde ennaku. Sinnanywa ku wayini newaakubadde ekitamiiza ekirala; mbadde nkaabira",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda mu mmeeme yange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuweereza wo tomulowooza okuba omukazi ow'ekyejjo, kubanga mbadde nsindira",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ennaku n'obuyinike bwange.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Eri n'amuddamu nti, \"Genda mirembe. Katonda wa Isirayiri akuwe ekyo ky'omusabye.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ayogera nti, \"Omuweereza wo alabe ekisa mu maaso go.\" Oluvannyuma ne yeetambulira, n'alya ku mmere, n'atandika okutunula n'essanyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Erukaana n'ab'ewuwe ne bagolokoka enkeera mu makya ne basinza",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", n'oluvannyuma ne baddayo ewaabwe e Laama. Ne yeetaba ne mukazi we Kaana,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda n'amujjukira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaana n'aba olubuto n'azaala omwana wabulenzi. N'amutuuma erinnya Samwiri, amakulu gaalyo, \"Kubanga namusaba",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kaana Awonga Samwiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Erukaana n'ayambuka n'ab'ennyumba ye okugenda okuwaayo ssaddaaka eri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda n'okutuukiriza obweyamo bwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Kaana teyagenda nabo. N'agamba bba nti, \"Omwana bw'aliva ku mabeere",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", ndimutwala ne mulagayo eri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda, era alibeera eyo ennaku ze zonna.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erukaana n'amuddamu nti, \"Kola nga bw'osiima. Linda okutuusa lw'olimala okumuggya ku mabeere;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda atuukirize ekigambo kye.\" Awo omukyala n'asigala eka, n'alabirira omwana okutuusa lwe yava ku mabeere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe yava ku mabeere, n'amutwala mu yeekaalu ya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda e Siiro ng'akyali muto; ne batwala ente ssatu ennume, n'endebe ey'obutta, n'eccupa y'envinnyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe baamala okusala emu ku nte, ne batwala omwana eri Eri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaana n'ayogera nti, \"Nga bw'oli omulamu mukama wange, nze mukyala oli eyayimirira okumpi naawe, ne nsaba",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.26",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namusaba omwana ono, era",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda ampadde kye namusaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaakano mmuwaayo eri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", era obulamu bwe bwonna aweereddwayo eri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda.\" Omwana n'asinzizanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1SA.1.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1SA.1.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda eyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.1.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
